  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feed Hungry Children Plant-Based School Meals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As increasing climate disasters worsen global food insecurity, climate-friendlier food aid is needed. A Well-Fed World sponsors culturally appropriate plant-based school meals for kids in need in communities experiencing hunger and poverty around the globe. For some children these lunches are their only full meal of the day, providing crucial nutrition and improved learning outcomes. Free school meal programs we&apos;ve sponsored or sponsor include schools in Ethiopia, Nepal, Uganda, India and Haiti.</narrative>
  </description>
